mw2coop patch for maps/_minigun_viewmodel.gsc (Team Player, Modern Warfare 2, 64-bit Steam build)

1. The turret hands follow the gunner's buttons (player 1 outside co-op).
@@@ replace
	for(;;)
	{
		if( level.player [[checkFunc]]() )
		{
			thread player_viewhands_minigun_presed( hand );
			while( level.player [[checkFunc]]() )
				wait 0.05;
		}
		else
		{
			thread player_viewhands_minigun_idle( hand );
			while( !level.player [[checkFunc]]() )
				wait 0.05;
		}
	}
@@@ with
	for(;;)
	{
		gunner = maps\_mw2coop::vehicle_gunner();
		if( gunner [[checkFunc]]() )
		{
			thread player_viewhands_minigun_presed( hand );
			while( gunner [[checkFunc]]() )
				wait 0.05;
		}
		else
		{
			thread player_viewhands_minigun_idle( hand );
			while( !gunner [[checkFunc]]() )
				wait 0.05;
		}
	}
@@@ end

2. Button checks run on the player they are called on.
@@@ replace
spinButtonPressed()
{
	if ( level.player AdsButtonPressed() )
		return true;
	if ( level.player AttackButtonPressed() )
		return true;
	return false;
}
@@@ with
spinButtonPressed()
{
	if ( self AdsButtonPressed() )
		return true;
	if ( self AttackButtonPressed() )
		return true;
	return false;
}
@@@ end

3. Same.
@@@ replace
fireButtonPressed()
{
	return level.player AttackButtonPressed();
}
@@@ with
fireButtonPressed()
{
	return self AttackButtonPressed();
}
@@@ end
